As a general advice for your contributions try to understand the issue from what is already written there and if you have questions formulate those precisely. If someone leaves an easy issue open its likely due to a lack of time or priority and most maintainers will not have the time to guide you trough this step by step. If you decide to implement something on an issue like this one and dont understand how to best do it i peronally think the best way is to document some clear results. In a case like this particular one that would mean post the code commented, properly formatted as a code block

```javascript
function timeConvert(n){ 
var num = n;
 if (num <= 90) { 
return num + " min";
 } else {
 var hours = num / 60; 
var rhours = Math.floor(hours); 
var mins = (hours - rhours) * 60; 
var rmins = Math.round(mins); 
if (mins == 0) { 
return rhours + " h"; 
} else { 
return rhours + " h " + rmins + " min";
 } 
} 
}
